{"id":59204,"date":"2026-08-13T07:21:07","date_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:21:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=59204"},"modified":"2026-10-01T11:16:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T10:16:02","slug":"bastofit-race-corrida-obstaculos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/bastofit-race-corrida-obstaculos\/","title":{"rendered":"BastoFit Race Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">BastoFit Race Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>BastoFit Race Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na tarde de domingo, <strong>4 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Cabeceiras de Basto<\/strong>, distrito de Braga. Promovida pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o BastoFit Race \/ Gin\u00e1sio BlueFit<\/strong> com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Cabeceiras de Basto<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desafia os atletas num eletrizante percurso de <strong>Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos (OCR)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida na <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio<\/strong> e meta consagrada no parque do imponente <strong>Mosteiro de S\u00e3o Miguel de Refojos<\/strong>, o circuito de <strong>9 km<\/strong> conta com mais de 30 obst\u00e1culos urbanos e naturais. A prova divide-se na <strong>Liga Competitive<\/strong> (para atletas que procuram a disputa pelo p\u00f3dio), <strong>Guerreiro Individual<\/strong> e <strong>Guerreiro por Equipas<\/strong>, proporcionando muita adrenalina e supera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 15:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; mi