aq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida tem lugar na Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio e a meta final est\u00e1 instalada no Parque do Mosteiro de S\u00e3o Miguel de Refojos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a extens\u00e3o do percurso e n\u00famero de obst\u00e1culos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso tem aproximadamente 9 km de extens\u00e3o e integra mais de 30 obst\u00e1culos variados ao longo do trajeto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os formatos de participa\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os participantes podem competir na Liga Competitive individual, no escal\u00e3o de divers\u00e3o Guerreiro Individual ou em grupo no formato Guerreiro por Equipas (m\u00ednimo de 3 atletas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Cyclones Sports at\u00e9 ao dia 2 de outubro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"BastoFit Race Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cabeceiras de Basto, Braga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Cabeceiras de Basto, Braga\", \"addressRegion\": \"Cabeceiras de Basto, Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a BastoFit Race 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova decorre no domingo, 4 de outubro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 15:00 na vila de Cabeceiras de Basto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localizam os pontos de partida e chegada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida tem lugar na Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio e a meta final est\u00e1 instalada no Parque do Mosteiro de S\u00e3o Miguel de Refojos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a extens\u00e3o do percurso e n\u00famero de obst\u00e1culos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso tem aproximadamente 9 km de extens\u00e3o e integra mais de 30 obst\u00e1culos variados ao longo do trajeto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os formatos de participa\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": 